        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Can you recover a car from inside the airport grounds?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
            <p>Yes. Let us know which car park or set-down area you're in, and whether the vehicle can be moved a short distance — even a few metres into a bay clear of traffic makes a big difference to how quickly we can work.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>My van has broken down on a business park in Dyce — can you help mid-week?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
            <p>Yes — we cover Dyce's business and industrial parks throughout the week. Give us the site name and unit number if you have it, along with a contact number, and we'll get a vehicle out to you.</p>
